    "题目类型": "填空题",
    "题干": "(2024年东台期末)计算$\\left(\\frac{25}{4}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{2}}-(0.6)^{0}-\\left(\\frac{27}{8}\\right)^{-\\frac{2}{3}}+(1.5)^{-2}=$__________。",
    "难度（1-5）": "3",
    "知识点标签": "分数指数幂;指数运算",
    "解析": "答案: $\\dfrac{3}{2}$   解析: $\\left(\\dfrac{25}{4}\\right)^{\\frac{1}{2}} - 0.6^{0} - \\left(\\dfrac{27}{8}\\right)^{-\\frac{2}{3}} + (1.5)^{-2} = \\dfrac{5}{2} - 1 - \\left(\\dfrac{2}{3}\\right)^{2} + \\left(\\dfrac{3}{2}\\right)^{-2} = \\dfrac{5}{2} - 1 - \\dfrac{4}{9} + \\dfrac{4}{9} = \\dfrac{3}{2}$。",
